# Silicon Labs Project Configuration Tools: slcp, v0, Component selection file.
project_name: wisun_rcp_pcb
label: wisun_rcp_pcb
description: |
  The Wi-SUN RCP (radio coprocessor) application provides a radio interface to a Linux host. It is meant to be paired with wsbrd (Wi-SUN Network implementation for Linux) to run as a Linux border router device.
category: Wi-SUN Examples
filter:
- name: Device Type
  value:
  - RCP
- name: Project Difficulty
  value:
  - Advanced
- name: Wireless Technology
  value:
  - Wi-SUN
package: wisun_rcp_app
quality: production
readme:
- path: readme.md
tag:
- prebuilt_demo
- hwfilter:device:device_supports_wisun
sdk:
  vendor: silabs
  id: simplicity_sdk
  version: 2026.6.2
toolchain_settings: [
  ]
